    "cora_about_story_Ly8xm7": {
      "type": "cora-about-story",
      "name": "Our Story ",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Our Story",
        "content": "<p>Imperial Knots is India’s most trusted destination for <strong>luxury handmade carpets, designer rugs, and custom rugs</strong>, proudly preserving the art of fine rug weaving since 1977. With nearly five decades of expertise, we are a leading <strong>carpet manufacturer and exporter</strong>, offering premium <strong>hand-knotted carpets, hand-tufted rugs, hand-woven dhurries, kilims, and sustainable jute rugs</strong> to customers across India and around the world.</p><p>Rooted in the historic weaving hubs of <strong>Mirzapur and Bhadohi</strong>, our rugs are handcrafted by master artisans using time-honoured techniques passed down through generations. Every Imperial Knots rug reflects exceptional craftsmanship, ethical sourcing, and timeless design—created to elevate homes, hotels, offices, and commercial spaces.</p><p></p><h2>Handcrafted Excellence & Premium Materials</h2><p>At Imperial Knots, we specialize in authentic <strong>hand-knotted rugs</strong>, considered the finest and most durable carpets in the world. These heirloom-quality rugs are meticulously woven knot by knot using <strong>New Zealand wool, bamboo silk, silk, viscose, mohair wool, cotton, and natural fibres</strong>, offering exceptional longevity, intricate detail, and luxurious texture.</p><p>In addition to hand-knotted carpets, our collections include:</p><ul><li><strong>Hand-tufted rugs</strong> for modern, decorative interiors</li><li><strong>Flatweave dhurries and kilims</strong> for lightweight, reversible use</li><li><strong>Eco-friendly jute rugs</strong> for sustainable, natural living</li></ul><p>Each rug is thoughtfully designed to balance beauty, durability, and comfort—making it suitable for both <strong>residential and commercial use</strong>.</p><h2>Rugs for Every Style, Space & Interior Vision</h2><p>Our curated collections feature thousands of designs across <strong>modern rugs, contemporary carpets, traditional Persian rugs, Moroccan rugs, geometric rugs, abstract rugs, floral rugs, shag rugs, and transitional styles</strong>. Available in all standard and custom sizes, including <strong>large area rugs and hallway runners</strong>, our rugs are crafted to suit every interior aesthetic.</p><p>Explore rugs by color—from <strong>neutral grey, beige, ivory, and brown rugs</strong> to bold <strong>blue, green, red, yellow, pink, and multicolor carpets</strong>—carefully curated to complement modern, classic, bohemian, or minimalist interiors.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/ILS-59_2.jpg",
        "stat_1_num": "200+",
