    "cora_rich_text_xmFkkY": {
      "type": "cora-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_HPhRxU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Custom Rugs & Bespoke Carpet Solutions</h3><p>Imperial Knots is renowned for its <strong>custom rug and bespoke carpet services</strong>, allowing complete personalization of size, color, pattern, and material. Whether you are designing a private residence, luxury villa, corporate office, or hospitality project, our expert team works closely with interior designers, architects, and clients to create one-of-a-kind rugs tailored to your exact specifications.</p><p>We also offer specialized solutions for:</p><ul><li><strong>Luxury hotel carpets & hotel rugs</strong></li><li><strong>Office rugs & commercial carpets</strong></li><li><strong>Reception areas, showrooms, retail stores & conference rooms</strong></li><li><strong>Durable broadloom carpets for high-traffic spaces</strong></li></ul><h3>Ethical Craftsmanship & Care & Fair Commitment</h3><p>Imperial Knots is a proud <strong>founding member of Care & Fair</strong>, an international NGO dedicated to the welfare of carpet-weaving communities. Our commitment ensures <strong>fair wages, safe working conditions, education for artisans’ children, healthcare support, and zero child labour</strong>. When you buy a rug from Imperial Knots, you directly support ethical craftsmanship and sustainable livelihoods.</p><h3>Shop Rugs Online with Confidence – India & Worldwide Shipping</h3><p>As India’s leading <strong>online carpet store</strong>, we offer a seamless shopping experience with <strong>free shipping across India</strong> and secure international delivery to major global destinations. Choose from <strong>ready-to-ship rugs</strong> for quick delivery or place made-to-order and custom rug requests with confidence.</p><p>From luxury homes to five-star hotels, Imperial Knots continues to be the preferred choice for those seeking the <strong>best carpets in India</strong>, combining heritage craftsmanship, modern design, and ethical excellence.</p><p><strong>Imperial Knots – Hand Knotted Carpets & Luxury Rugs Since 1977</strong><br/>Timeless design. Ethical craftsmanship. Global delivery.</p>"
